{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-hilbert-bernays.md","title":"Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions","display":"df-hilbert-bernays — Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","aliases":["89-df-hilbert-bernays"],"display":"df-hilbert-bernays — Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-hilbert-bernays"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-hilbert-bernays</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hilbert-bernays — Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is the fixed one-free-variable arithmetical\nprovability formula, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> is the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-provable sentences.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> is the fixed Gödel numbering and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> is the numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元可导出性条件谓词，两个参数为理论及该理论所选的可证性公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\Bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\\Bigl(\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner}\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\Bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\\Bigl(\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner}\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>三个合取依次是外部可推导性、内部化的分配条件和正内省条件。</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 先在元层取得 Gödel 数，再以对应数词\n代入对象语言公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}bernays}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\Bigr)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\\Bigl(\n\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner}\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false}],"bytes":2030,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1c8665663a75504","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646431d492b